"""Operator page for original Analysis lineage reviews and publications."""

HTML = r'''
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Analysis lineage · Stellar Forge</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/lineage.css"><script src="/lineage.js" defer></script></head>
<body><header><div><a id="lineage-home" href="/">STELLAR FORGE / ANALYSIS</a><h1>Lineage publications</h1><p>Review the original source, query and workbook history. Retain one publication and its collector receipt.</p></div><button id="lineage-refresh" type="button">Refresh workspace</button></header>
<main><p id="lineage-message" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite">Opening the original Analysis workspace…</p><div class="identity"><span>ANALYSIS WORKSPACE</span><code id="lineage-workspace">—</code></div>
<section id="lineage-recovery" hidden><h2>Retained action needs attention</h2><p id="lineage-recovery-text"></p><div class="actions"><button id="lineage-recover-plan">Continue exact saved review</button></div><details><summary>Original request</summary><pre id="lineage-recovery-request"></pre></details></section>
<div class="layout"><div class="primary">
<section><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / ORIGINAL ANALYSIS</p><h2>Select a completed operation</h2></div><button id="lineage-jobs-refresh">Refresh operations</button></div><p class="hint">Imported immutable versions, saved queries, complete query exports and workbooks. This review reads their retained records.</p>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Operation</th><th>Completed</th><th>Rows and scope</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="lineage-jobs"></tbody></table></div><div class="pagination"><button id="lineage-jobs-previous">Newer</button><span id="lineage-jobs-page"></span><button id="lineage-jobs-next">Older</button></div>
<label>Original operation ID<input id="lineage-job" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off" maxlength="32" placeholder="32-character Analysis job ID"></label>
<label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="lineage-include-sql"><span>Include the original SQL text in the collector events. Parameter values and result rows stay out of the event source.</span></label>
<button id="lineage-review">Review retained lineage</button>
</section>
<section id="lineage-review-panel" hidden><p class="eyebrow">02 / REVIEWED SOURCE</p><h2>Exact jobs and datasets</h2><div id="lineage-review-facts" class="facts"></div><div id="lineage-review-warnings" class="notes"></div><div id="lineage-review-graph"></div>
<details><summary>Events that will be sent</summary><label>Event<select id="lineage-review-event"></select></label><pre id="lineage-review-json"></pre><p class="hint">Long records are shortened here. The frozen plan provides the complete original JSON download.</p></details>
<div class="fields"><label>Collector profile<select id="lineage-connection"><option value="">Select a configured profile</option></select></label><div id="lineage-connection-facts" class="facts"></div><label>Publication title<input id="lineage-title" maxlength="160" value="Analysis lineage"></label><label>Review note<textarea id="lineage-note" maxlength="4000" rows="4" placeholder="Record why this source and scope are ready to publish."></textarea></label></div><p class="hint">The profile is configured by the local launcher. Its token and connection-file path stay on the server.</p><button id="lineage-save-plan">Freeze reviewed publication</button></section>
<section id="lineage-plan-panel" hidden><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / SAVED PUBLICATION</p><h2 id="lineage-plan-title"></h2></div><button id="lineage-plan-refresh">Read original record</button></div><div id="lineage-plan-facts" class="facts"></div><p id="lineage-plan-note" class="operator-note"></p><div id="lineage-plan-graph"></div>
<div class="publication"><p class="eyebrow">COLLECTOR DELIVERY</p><h3 id="lineage-publication-status"></h3><p id="lineage-publication-explanation"></p><div id="lineage-publication-facts" class="facts"></div><div class="actions"><button id="lineage-publish">Publish reviewed source</button><button id="lineage-continue">Continue original publication</button><button id="lineage-read-publication">Read original attempt</button><button id="lineage-cancel">Stop this local attempt</button></div><p id="lineage-publication-error" class="error"></p><details><summary>Native receipt and request identity</summary><pre id="lineage-receipt"></pre></details><details><summary>Retained attempt observations</summary><div id="lineage-observations"></div></details></div>
<h3>Portable handover</h3><p class="hint">The handover preserves the frozen event source, exact native bindings, review and publication receipts. The Analysis backup also carries the underlying source documents, tables, query exports and workbooks.</p><div class="actions downloads"><button data-lineage-download="handover.zip">Complete handover ZIP</button><button data-lineage-download="report.html">Printable report</button><button data-lineage-download="events.json">Event source JSON</button><button data-lineage-download="native-bindings.json">Native bindings</button><button data-lineage-download="receipts.json">Receipts</button><button data-lineage-download="manifest.json">Handover manifest</button></div><details><summary>Frozen events</summary><label>Event<select id="lineage-plan-event"></select></label><pre id="lineage-plan-json"></pre></details></section>
</div><aside><section><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SAVED HISTORY</p><h2>Publications</h2></div><button id="lineage-plans-refresh">Refresh</button></div><div id="lineage-plans" class="saved"></div><div class="pagination"><button id="lineage-plans-previous">Newer</button><button id="lineage-plans-next">Older</button></div><label>Original plan ID<input id="lineage-plan-id" maxlength="32" spellcheck="false" autocomplete="off"></label><button id="lineage-open-plan">Open saved publication</button></section><section><h2>Publication scope</h2><p>Each completed job supplies its original start and finish times. These events describe retained work retrospectively.</p><p>A saved query may contain a limited preview. A query export has its own complete result and original output hashes.</p><p>Imported source identities and workbook sheet mappings stay explicit. Unknown or ambiguous earlier writers appear as review notes.</p><p>A stopped attempt can have reached the collector. Continue its existing source key to reconcile that outcome.</p></section></aside></div></main><footer>Original Analysis records · exact event source · retained collector acknowledgement</footer></body></html>
'''

